    "text_full": "Cookie Settings\nMain Content\nMain Menu\nSEARCH\nMENU\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nFirm\nContact Us\nDirections\nFIRM\nDirections\nMetro\n\nWiley is located within a five-minute walk from the Red, Blue, Silver, and Orange Metro lines.\n\nDupont Circle, serving the Red Line, is the closest Metro station and is located nearby at 19th and Connecticut Ave NW. It is accessible via the escalators located on the corner of 19th and Connecticut Ave NW at street level.\n\nParking\nParking Garage:\tONE PARKING\nHours:\t6:00 a.m. – 11:00 p.m. Monday – Friday\n \t11:00 a.m. – 8:00 p.m. Saturday\n \tClosed Sunday\n \tMonthly contract holders have 24-hour access\n \t \nCost:\t$21.50 daily – $15.50 Early Bird (before 9 a.m.)\n \t$310 per month (unreserved)\n \t$600 per month (reserved)\n \t \nFind Us\n\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nFirm\nCareers\nInclusion and Engagement\nHome\nSite Map\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nCookies Policy & Settings\nCalifornia Privacy Notice\n© 2026 Wiley Rein LLP All Rights Reserved.\nSubscribe\n\nOur Site uses cookies to improve your experience. Cookies may collect your personal information, such as IP address or device identifier, which we may disclose to our analytics partners. You may opt out of the cookies that are not strictly necessary if you wish. By using this site, you agree to our updated Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, and Cookies Policy.\n\nCUSTOMIZE COOKIE CHOICES\nREJECT ALL COOKIES\nACCEPT ALL COOKIES"
